[.tooling/components/apis/ai-gov-review-service/docs/api-specification.md#training-record-schema]

## Training Record Schema

```typescript
interface TrainingRecord {
  record_id: string;
  review_id: string;
  review_type: string;
  iteration: 1 | 2;  // 1 = AI output, 2 = human-approved
  section_id: string;
  input_content: string;
  output_content: string;  // Section evaluation JSON
  created_at: string;      // ISO 8601
  reviewer_id?: string;    // For v2 only
}
```

