## Error Response Format

All errors follow this structure:

```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "ERROR_CODE",
    "message": "Human-readable error message",
    "details": {
      "field": "field_name",
      "reason": "Specific reason for error"
    },
    "request_id": "req-12345678-abcd-efgh",
    "timestamp": "2026-01-06T14:30:00Z"
  }
}
```
